**Root cause addressed:** 100% AISF-header-positive training (V1/V2) caused conditional
activation failure -- model associated AISF commentary with Alpaca format itself, not
header presence. IFEval (no header) triggered bleed in all responses. Fix: ~120 negative
examples teach header = trigger; no header = clean general-purpose response.

