refusals (P0/P1/WCAG/safety variants), multilingual refusals (Hindi/Urdu/Arabic/Somali),
format-constrained negatives (IFEval coverage: lowercase, uppercase, no-comma, JSON-only,
sentence/paragraph counts, start/end-with, highlighted sections, combination constraints).

